// GIF binary - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# A real 1x1 GIF89a whose comment extension carries "Hello World!".
# 21 FE is the comment extension introducer; 3B is the trailer.
0000  47 49 46 38 39 61 01 00 01 00 F0 00 00 00 00 00 |GIF89a..........|
0010  FF FF FF 21 FE 0C 00 48 65 6C 6C 6F 20 57 6F 72 |...!...Hello Wor|
0020  6C 64 21 00 3B                                  |ld!.;|
